WEBVTT

00:21.279 --> 00:22.709
(Ryeo Un)

00:24.049 --> 00:25.920
(Choi Hyun Wook)

00:27.990 --> 00:29.650
(Seol In Ah)

00:34.630 --> 00:36.560
(Shin Eun Soo)

00:44.200 --> 00:47.939
(Twinkling Watermelon)

00:47.940 --> 00:49.409
(Production sponsors)

00:49.410 --> 00:50.879
(Ministry of Culture, Sports and Tourism, KOCCA)

00:50.880 --> 00:51.880
(All people, organizations, locations, and incidents...)

00:51.880 --> 00:52.880
(in this drama are fictitious.)

00:52.880 --> 00:53.880
(Staff ensured child actors' safety in the filming of this drama.)

01:06.259 --> 01:07.660
You said you'd keep me safe.

01:11.630 --> 01:13.100
You said you'd help me get into college...

01:14.929 --> 01:16.230
and that we should start a band together.

01:21.309 --> 01:23.709
Ha Eun Gyeol! Where are you, seriously?

01:36.490 --> 01:37.520
So...

01:39.020 --> 01:40.220
I've returned to the present?

02:02.080 --> 02:03.809
(To Die For Chicken)

02:05.350 --> 02:07.050
(To Die For Chicken)

02:08.449 --> 02:10.850
(Episode 8)

02:14.929 --> 02:17.159
Mom! Dad! Eun Ho!

02:17.160 --> 02:19.000
Dad! Eun Ho.

02:23.169 --> 02:24.769
What's with you? Why are you being so clingy today?

02:26.039 --> 02:27.639
Where's Mom? Where is she?

02:28.069 --> 02:29.568
She's out with friends. She'll be home late.

02:29.569 --> 02:31.340
She said to go ahead and have dinner without her.

02:32.639 --> 02:33.710
What's for dinner?

02:34.380 --> 02:35.479
Ramyeon.

02:35.880 --> 02:38.019
Ramyeon? It'll be so good.

02:39.780 --> 02:40.919
What's with him today?

02:46.590 --> 02:47.889
My gosh. It's so good.

02:50.759 --> 02:52.060
A dream? What kind of dream?

02:52.759 --> 02:55.829
In the dream, I travelled back to 1995...

02:56.069 --> 02:57.430
and met Dad.

02:58.299 --> 02:59.370
Did you say 1995?

03:00.940 --> 03:03.470
I was 18 back then.

03:04.039 --> 03:05.979
That's right. The same age as I am now.

03:08.380 --> 03:10.650
Dad, I tutored you in the dream,

03:11.220 --> 03:12.449
and we started a band together.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.949
Oh, right. I went to Snail Guesthouse too.

03:15.319 --> 03:16.949
And I met Great-grandma there.

03:18.660 --> 03:20.319
What about me? You didn't see me in your dream?

03:21.829 --> 03:24.030
Hey, it was way before you were born.

03:27.299 --> 03:29.470
So what did you think of me when you met me in your dream?

03:31.239 --> 03:32.340
I was super cool, right?

03:33.870 --> 03:35.009
Please. Give me a break.

03:35.810 --> 03:38.479
Dad, do you even know what I went through because of you?

03:39.710 --> 03:41.249
You never studied.

03:41.250 --> 03:43.509
- Stop, wait!
- You always worried your grandma.

03:44.750 --> 03:46.679
- Se Gyeong.
- You said Mom was your first love.

03:46.680 --> 03:47.749
Where have you been?

03:47.750 --> 03:49.889
- But you were chasing another girl.
- I looked everywhere for you.

03:50.049 --> 03:51.489
What? Another girl?

03:51.720 --> 03:52.859
Are you serious?

03:53.060 --> 03:54.660
If Mom finds out, she'll be upset.

03:55.590 --> 03:58.129
No, that's not true. Your mom has always been the only one for me.

03:58.130 --> 04:00.199
Your mom was my first love.

04:02.470 --> 04:03.630
Oh, that must be Mom.

04:04.739 --> 04:06.699
I should ask Mom directly.

04:07.269 --> 04:08.869
No, don't do that.

04:08.870 --> 04:10.310
I will. I'll tell her everything.

04:12.639 --> 04:13.639
Mom!

04:19.449 --> 04:20.819
Everyone's here.

04:21.289 --> 04:22.789
Have you guys had dinner yet?

04:24.090 --> 04:25.519
If you go back now,

04:25.759 --> 04:28.129
your 2023 will look very different...

04:28.130 --> 04:30.160
from the 2023 you came from.

04:30.559 --> 04:32.059
Do you still wish to go back?

04:35.200 --> 04:36.299
I don't believe this.

04:36.999 --> 04:39.400
What's wrong, Eun Gyeol? Are you not feeling well?

04:40.570 --> 04:42.840
Oh, no. I guess you didn't know.

04:43.510 --> 04:45.938
The moment you arrived here,

04:45.939 --> 04:48.280
everything started to change.

04:48.780 --> 04:50.350
- Eun Gyeol.
- No.

04:50.710 --> 04:51.879
What's wrong, sweetheart?

04:52.179 --> 04:53.279
It's me, your mom.

04:53.280 --> 04:55.450
No. This can't be happening!

05:01.760 --> 05:03.929
What is this? What happened?

05:04.660 --> 05:05.929
What is this place?

05:08.929 --> 05:10.900
(Jinsung Musical Instruments)

05:11.400 --> 05:13.200
It's 1995?

05:52.609 --> 05:55.010
(CEO Yoon Gun Hyung)

05:57.350 --> 05:59.350
Chairman Yoon Gun Hyung of Jinsung Musical Instruments?

06:08.090 --> 06:09.859
Take this. You'll catch a cold.

06:18.539 --> 06:20.070
Isn't she the girl from that day?

06:20.299 --> 06:22.439
Don't tell me you're about to run away.

06:39.289 --> 06:42.289
That's odd. He wouldn't be late without a heads-up.

06:48.799 --> 06:50.830
Please leave a message after the tone.

06:53.439 --> 06:56.039
Yi Chan, it's me. I can't reach you.

06:56.369 --> 06:59.439
I'm going to head home now. Call me at home when you get this.

08:31.840 --> 08:34.438
It's you. I nearly bumped into you earlier.

08:34.439 --> 08:36.209
- Se Gyeong?
- Oh, no.

08:36.210 --> 08:37.840
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

08:39.809 --> 08:40.809
That's blood.

08:41.749 --> 08:44.650
Did you get hurt when I bumped into you earlier?

08:45.879 --> 08:46.879
My gosh.

08:47.720 --> 08:50.519
Hey, wait! Where are you going?

08:51.960 --> 08:54.189
Why are you dragging me to a dark alley?

08:54.190 --> 08:55.229
Wait!

08:56.460 --> 08:57.998
Chung Ah? "Yoon Chung Ah?"

08:57.999 --> 09:00.859
Hey, Chung Ah. Let's talk first.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.498
Hey, where are you taking me?

09:02.499 --> 09:04.670
Hey! Violence is bad.

09:09.639 --> 09:10.670
Is that Yi Chan?

09:14.540 --> 09:16.950
Yi Chan! What happened?

09:17.509 --> 09:18.879
Help!

09:18.950 --> 09:21.488
Someone has collapsed. Anybody there?

09:21.489 --> 09:22.720
What's wrong?

09:23.090 --> 09:24.349
Can you please call 911?

09:24.350 --> 09:25.388
Someone has collapsed.

09:25.389 --> 09:27.119
Okay, I'll call them now!

09:29.590 --> 09:32.800
Yi Chan, Ha Yi Chan. Wake up.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.629
Open your eyes. Yi Chan!

09:35.229 --> 09:37.300
Se Gyeong.

09:38.800 --> 09:40.440
Stop shaking me like that.

09:41.070 --> 09:43.609
My head hurts so much. It's killing me.

09:43.739 --> 09:45.940
What? You woke up.

09:46.279 --> 09:48.050
Do you recognize me?

09:50.050 --> 09:51.249
Hey, what happened?

09:52.080 --> 09:53.149
Can you get up?

09:54.690 --> 09:56.590
- Help me up.
- Okay.

09:58.060 --> 09:59.320
Who are you, really?

10:00.859 --> 10:04.129
I tried to find out...

10:04.229 --> 10:06.259
but couldn't find anything on you.

10:06.300 --> 10:07.460
Who are you?

10:08.930 --> 10:10.868
Not a single belonging,

10:10.869 --> 10:12.139
let alone an ID card.

10:12.739 --> 10:14.239
Oh, my bag.

10:21.749 --> 10:23.909
You weren't there to participate in the audition.

10:26.149 --> 10:27.778
Let me explain what happened.

10:27.779 --> 10:30.018
I had a bit of a situation, so I went to the audition...

10:30.019 --> 10:31.689
and found an invitation someone had dropped.

10:31.690 --> 10:32.988
But the staff saw that and assumed...

10:32.989 --> 10:34.719
I was there to participate in the audition.

10:34.720 --> 10:36.359
- Are you a spy?
- Pardon me?

10:36.690 --> 10:38.759
I bet you're a spy one of our competitors sent.

10:39.859 --> 10:41.229
Or are you a flopper?

10:41.499 --> 10:42.570
If not that,

10:42.899 --> 10:45.540
are you a blackmailer or something?

10:46.239 --> 10:49.540
You seem totally uninterested in listening to me or believing me,

10:49.769 --> 10:51.238
so think whatever you want.

10:51.239 --> 10:52.580
I'll be off, then.

10:52.940 --> 10:54.080
Where are you going? Sit down.

10:54.609 --> 10:55.680
Sit back down!

10:58.279 --> 11:01.248
I can't let you go like this after spending all that money...

11:01.249 --> 11:02.550
and manpower to sneak you out.

11:03.119 --> 11:05.090
Do you think I brought you here because I like you?

11:05.690 --> 11:07.789
Reporters are camping out in front of the hospital because of you,

11:07.790 --> 11:10.159
and the company's public image is about to go down the drain.

11:10.460 --> 11:12.060
I have no idea what you're saying now.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.829
I have to go. I have an urgent matter to attend to.

11:13.830 --> 11:14.999
If you want to leave...

11:19.940 --> 11:21.340
You'll have to sign this written pledge.

11:22.369 --> 11:24.738
A written pledge? About what?

11:24.739 --> 11:26.138
I'm the victim. Why should I...

11:26.139 --> 11:29.550
Look at this. You're already calling yourself a victim.

11:30.779 --> 11:32.019
My gosh.

11:32.350 --> 11:34.778
You'll leave like this with your innocent-looking doe eyes...

11:34.779 --> 11:36.050
only to spread false rumours.

11:36.149 --> 11:38.460
In the end, you'll do a 180 and come at us aggressively...

11:38.790 --> 11:40.019
for settlement money.

11:45.359 --> 11:46.759
(Pledge)

11:49.570 --> 11:51.100
(Ha Eun Gyeol)

11:52.639 --> 11:53.639
Are we good now?

11:56.609 --> 11:58.540
- Make sure you get this notarized.
- Yes, sir.

12:10.149 --> 12:11.320
Oh, aren't you that girl from...

12:14.259 --> 12:15.330
I'm sorry.

12:18.460 --> 12:19.729
(Yoon Chung Ah)

12:22.729 --> 12:23.970
"Yoon Chung Ah."

12:25.070 --> 12:26.139
"Yoon Chung Ah?"

12:29.070 --> 12:30.139
It's Mom.

12:31.139 --> 12:32.180
Mom!

12:32.909 --> 12:34.509
Mom! It's me, Eun Gyeol!

12:34.680 --> 12:36.609
Let go of me. There's something I must check.

12:36.850 --> 12:38.220
Hey, let go!

12:39.820 --> 12:40.820
Stop right there.

12:43.050 --> 12:44.249
Let go!

12:44.320 --> 12:45.590
Let go of me!

12:45.720 --> 12:47.590
Mom!

12:47.920 --> 12:49.229
What's all the fuss about?

12:51.960 --> 12:54.628
Sir, this boy here keeps calling Miss Chung Ah "Mom."

12:54.629 --> 12:56.629
He said he needed to check something.

12:56.800 --> 12:57.999
That crazy idiot.

12:58.369 --> 13:00.399
I'm done negotiating with him, so drag him out at once.

13:05.080 --> 13:06.080
Are you out of your mind?

13:06.340 --> 13:08.449
Our deal is now null and void. I refuse to leave this place.

13:08.450 --> 13:10.449
- Hey!
- You'd better not kick me out.

13:10.450 --> 13:12.179
If you do, I'll go straight to the office.

13:12.180 --> 13:14.579
I'll meet with the chairman and take it up with him.

13:14.580 --> 13:15.690
You little piece of...

13:18.960 --> 13:21.420
Hey, get up.

13:22.690 --> 13:24.960
Stop putting on an act. Get up, you punk!

13:26.560 --> 13:28.029
Hey.

13:29.070 --> 13:31.470
Hey!

13:49.489 --> 13:52.320
Earlier, I clearly heard them calling Mom "Miss Chung Ah."

13:52.720 --> 13:54.220
That means...

13:54.720 --> 13:56.259
this is where Mom and her family live.

13:56.590 --> 13:58.629
Chairman Yoon Gun Hyung is my maternal grandfather,

13:58.960 --> 14:02.629
and that obnoxious scumbag is my uncle?

14:02.930 --> 14:03.999
That's strange.

14:04.999 --> 14:07.499
I clearly remember Mom telling me that she had no family.

14:09.369 --> 14:10.369
Why?

14:11.369 --> 14:12.710
Why did she say that?

14:17.879 --> 14:19.349
Bring us something cold to drink.

14:19.350 --> 14:20.420
Yes, ma'am.

14:22.489 --> 14:23.850
Oh, boy.

14:27.619 --> 14:28.659
You're back.

14:29.859 --> 14:31.059
You're back, ma'am.

14:31.060 --> 14:33.929
What? Hey, Mom doesn't really like it...

14:33.930 --> 14:36.399
when she sees you with Attorney Jung.

14:38.070 --> 14:39.570
Go to your room, Sang A.

14:39.800 --> 14:40.869
Yes, ma'am.

14:48.279 --> 14:51.210
You. What did you do this time?

14:53.479 --> 14:55.019
Mom, the thing is...

14:55.590 --> 14:57.789
It's about the boy who had an electric shock the other day.

14:57.790 --> 15:00.920
I told you to watch your conduct until Mr. Chairman comes home!

15:13.899 --> 15:16.340
Hey, seriously. Get your face out of my sight!

15:18.009 --> 15:19.739
Goodness. I'm not even surprised anymore.

15:21.749 --> 15:23.379
Did you get into another fight?

15:27.749 --> 15:28.850
What is this?

15:33.560 --> 15:34.820
What's with this reaction?

15:35.690 --> 15:36.989
Something's fishy.

15:38.859 --> 15:40.100
Hey, did you steal this?

15:40.999 --> 15:42.570
Is that why there's blood all over this?

15:45.470 --> 15:46.670
Is this a limited edition?

15:48.139 --> 15:50.070
Anyway, thanks for this. I'll put this to good use.

15:53.680 --> 15:56.950
Hey! It hurts! Let go!

15:59.450 --> 16:00.680
Hey!

16:01.950 --> 16:03.050
Stay here.

16:03.149 --> 16:05.518
But I just heard a scream.

16:05.519 --> 16:06.758
Pretend you heard nothing.

16:06.759 --> 16:07.889
Pretend you're not here.

16:08.320 --> 16:09.960
For your own sake, that is.

16:20.300 --> 16:21.340
Hey!

16:25.739 --> 16:26.810
My hair.

16:28.340 --> 16:29.979
My hair!

16:32.019 --> 16:33.618
I'll pull your hair out too.

16:33.619 --> 16:35.420
I'll make you look like a featherless chicken.

16:35.920 --> 16:38.488
Let go! You'd better let go of me. Let go!

16:38.489 --> 16:39.960
Stop at once!

16:41.060 --> 16:42.359
What are you two doing right now?

16:42.859 --> 16:44.359
Mom.

16:44.729 --> 16:47.359
You see, Chung Ah...

16:47.529 --> 16:50.200
took my key ring from me.

16:50.269 --> 16:52.498
I asked her to give it back,

16:52.499 --> 16:54.998
but she grabbed me by the hair...

16:54.999 --> 16:56.869
and insisted that it was hers.

16:56.970 --> 17:01.710
Se Gyeong brought it for me from Europe as a gift.

17:07.350 --> 17:08.379
Hand it over.

17:23.429 --> 17:24.570
Shut your mouth.

17:26.070 --> 17:27.100
I told you to shut it.

17:30.770 --> 17:31.980
What are you, a lowly brute?

17:32.280 --> 17:34.139
If you're human, speak like one.

17:36.080 --> 17:37.949
- Mom?
- Shut your mouth.

17:38.080 --> 17:39.219
It's Mom.

17:42.590 --> 17:44.449
Do I have to repeat the warning?

17:44.790 --> 17:46.490
What do you people do?

17:47.060 --> 17:49.060
Do you skin people alive and make musical instruments with it?

17:49.659 --> 17:51.290
I must check, so step aside.

18:00.300 --> 18:02.139
Do I have to tie you up to make you behave yourself?

18:02.510 --> 18:04.709
Must I lock you up to make you listen to me?

18:20.419 --> 18:21.459
Those eyes.

18:22.490 --> 18:24.659
I told you not to glare at me like that.

18:30.600 --> 18:32.469
What are you doing now?

18:47.919 --> 18:50.990
Weren't you told to stay in the guest room?

18:51.990 --> 18:53.158
Did you not tell him?

18:53.159 --> 18:55.090
We couldn't stop him. He was being stubborn, ma'am.

19:00.100 --> 19:01.100
Are you all right?

19:01.760 --> 19:03.070
Aren't you hurt?

19:04.369 --> 19:05.369
Sign language?

19:06.040 --> 19:07.340
What are you doing now?

19:07.939 --> 19:09.639
You're not allowed to use sign language in this house.

19:09.810 --> 19:11.770
What kind of nonsense is that?

19:12.780 --> 19:14.609
She's deaf. If she's not allowed to use sign language,

19:15.580 --> 19:18.149
then how on earth is she supposed to express herself?

19:23.350 --> 19:24.719
Tell me what's going on.

19:27.419 --> 19:29.560
You can tell me everything, Mom.

19:34.000 --> 19:35.030
"Mom?"

19:36.169 --> 19:38.129
You must've been taken aback by all the fuss.

19:39.139 --> 19:41.500
I was simply trying to discipline her as her mother.

19:42.540 --> 19:45.039
Instead of meddling in our family matters, pretend you didn't see...

19:45.040 --> 19:47.609
"Discipline?" Did you say you were trying to discipline her?

19:49.649 --> 19:51.979
What I saw today was clearly violence.

19:51.980 --> 19:53.020
Hey.

19:54.449 --> 19:56.889
Can't you see this? And my hair!

19:57.520 --> 19:59.659
That thing bit her and pulled my hair out.

19:59.859 --> 20:01.490
- "That thing?" - That's right.

20:03.230 --> 20:05.659
I asked you politely, but you aren't listening.

20:06.600 --> 20:09.629
Then I have no choice but to be rude.

20:10.500 --> 20:12.270
What are you waiting for? Drag him out at once.

20:15.639 --> 20:18.139
Let go. I told you to let go!

20:18.879 --> 20:19.980
Does the chairman know?

20:20.639 --> 20:22.679
Does he know what's going on in this house...

20:23.109 --> 20:25.448
and how your daughter is being treated?

20:25.449 --> 20:26.648
Does the chairman know?

20:26.649 --> 20:28.378
Shut his mouth at once!

20:28.379 --> 20:29.689
I'll tell everyone.

20:29.820 --> 20:31.719
Everything I saw and heard here.

20:31.820 --> 20:34.059
I'll tell the whole world!

20:34.060 --> 20:35.629
Let me hear it first.

20:38.800 --> 20:40.600
- Mr. Chairman.
- Dad.

20:41.959 --> 20:43.030
Father.

20:44.399 --> 20:46.399
Weren't you supposed to return the day after tomorrow?

20:47.340 --> 20:48.938
If your schedule changed,

20:48.939 --> 20:51.270
why didn't you tell me?

20:55.750 --> 20:57.310
Are you Chairman Yoon Gun Hyung?

20:58.879 --> 21:00.178
You must be the unlucky guest...

21:00.179 --> 21:02.389
who had the accident because of my son.

21:03.590 --> 21:05.959
Let's hear it. Since it concerns my family,

21:06.919 --> 21:09.929
I should hear it before everyone else finds out.

21:13.830 --> 21:16.000
(Yeonnam Hospital)

21:27.740 --> 21:31.080
(Audiology Room)

21:33.520 --> 21:35.379
What did they say? Nothing's wrong with you?

21:37.820 --> 21:38.859
That's right.

21:39.159 --> 21:40.619
My hearing is as good as that of Jaime Sommers, the Bionic Woman.

21:41.290 --> 21:43.760
What about your head? Did they take an X-ray of your head too?

21:44.230 --> 21:46.659
Yes, it's totally fine. There isn't a single hairline fracture.

21:47.030 --> 21:48.399
I can go home tomorrow, as planned.

21:48.929 --> 21:50.030
Hey, Ma Joo. Applause.

21:52.570 --> 21:54.240
Hey, did you lie then?

21:54.540 --> 21:56.570
What the... Why would I lie about something like that?

21:56.969 --> 21:59.879
I swear. I heard a whooshing sound in my ear...

22:00.109 --> 22:02.609
and felt as though some alien was trying to talk to me.

22:03.980 --> 22:05.379
What do you even know?

22:08.990 --> 22:10.050
Oh, right.

22:10.320 --> 22:12.520
- Did you take care of that thing?
- Yes.

22:13.159 --> 22:16.029
Bal San will be here as your guardian for your discharge,

22:16.030 --> 22:18.089
and he called the school saying he's your cousin.

22:18.090 --> 22:20.659
I see. Nice. He's very useful.

22:21.959 --> 22:25.230
Oh, give my thanks to your father.

22:26.070 --> 22:29.270
As for the hospital bill, tell him that I'll be sure to pay him back.

22:29.639 --> 22:30.709
Don't worry about it.

22:30.969 --> 22:32.938
You always help us carry stuff at our fabric store.

22:32.939 --> 22:33.939
Dad said not to worry.

22:33.940 --> 22:35.850
Oh, Grandma!

22:37.250 --> 22:38.480
Don't run. Be careful.

22:39.250 --> 22:40.679
Where are you going? The restroom?

22:41.250 --> 22:43.688
You should've told me. I would've come to get you.

22:43.689 --> 22:44.689
That's all right.

22:45.219 --> 22:46.619
Did you watch the drama yesterday?

22:46.959 --> 22:48.389
I did, of course.

22:48.459 --> 22:49.759
See? What did I tell you?

22:49.760 --> 22:51.659
I told you that they must be siblings.

22:51.760 --> 22:53.999
Yes, I know. What's going to happen now?

22:54.000 --> 22:55.459
It's okay.

22:55.669 --> 22:56.770
It'll be revealed...

22:57.300 --> 22:59.699
that they aren't blood-related, so they'll end up together.

23:00.000 --> 23:01.239
- Really?
- Yes.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.909
My gosh. What a relief.

23:03.010 --> 23:06.608
So go ahead and use the restroom. Take your time.

23:06.609 --> 23:08.408
- My, he makes friends so easily.
- Wait here.

23:08.409 --> 23:10.178
Okay. Don't you worry.

23:10.179 --> 23:11.479
People would think he's a long-term patient here.

23:11.480 --> 23:13.980
Hey! Come here.

23:15.179 --> 23:16.489
Is running allowed inside the hospital or not?

23:16.490 --> 23:18.089
It is not allowed, Captain!

23:18.090 --> 23:19.619
Good. Salute!

23:20.760 --> 23:22.119
- At ease!
- Yes, sir.

23:22.830 --> 23:24.659
Yi Seul, what happened to your hair?

23:25.429 --> 23:27.500
I'll braid your hair for you later.

23:27.560 --> 23:29.029
Come to my room after dinner.

23:29.030 --> 23:31.369
- Okay, my hairstylist!
- Okay, my princess!

23:34.570 --> 23:36.608
So you've joined the military and opened a hair salon.

23:36.609 --> 23:37.639
I see that you've been very busy.

23:38.740 --> 23:39.909
That reminds me.

23:40.580 --> 23:41.810
You didn't tell my grandma, right?

23:42.139 --> 23:45.509
I did. She called me in the morning, so I told her everything.

23:45.510 --> 23:47.879
You little... Have you got a death wish?

23:48.719 --> 23:50.149
Hey, I was just kidding.

23:50.649 --> 23:52.520
I said you were staying with me for a few days to study all night.

23:53.159 --> 23:54.359
Good job, Cheetah.

23:56.030 --> 23:57.030
Now, run.

24:26.260 --> 24:28.159
Oh, are you going somewhere?

24:28.260 --> 24:29.859
Hey, good timing. I'm glad you're here.

24:30.030 --> 24:31.359
Hey, Bal San.

24:31.560 --> 24:34.359
You know where Ma Joo's father's fabric store is, right?

24:34.859 --> 24:36.968
Yes, it's in Dongdaemun.

24:36.969 --> 24:38.299
I went there a few times to get some fabric.

24:38.300 --> 24:39.368
- I see.
- Why do you ask?

24:39.369 --> 24:41.600
You lead the way. I want to go to that store.

24:41.969 --> 24:43.369
What? Why?

24:43.469 --> 24:46.480
Yi Chan didn't come home last night.

24:47.010 --> 24:49.108
I heard he'd eat and sleep there for 3 to 4 days...

24:49.109 --> 24:51.179
to study for his exams.

24:51.810 --> 24:54.279
I can't just send my grandson there and pretend not to know about it.

24:54.280 --> 24:56.520
I want to thank Ma Joo's father,

24:56.619 --> 24:58.549
so I'm going to drop off some side dishes for them.

24:58.550 --> 25:00.590
Gosh, just leave it.

25:00.889 --> 25:02.260
Don't go.

25:02.459 --> 25:05.230
Besides, Ma Joo eats so much whenever he's here.

25:05.659 --> 25:08.560
They're always so busy handling customers and delivering orders.

25:08.730 --> 25:10.669
It'll be a hassle for them if you show up unannounced.

25:12.169 --> 25:13.698
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?

25:13.699 --> 25:15.399
Gosh, what are you talking about?

25:15.709 --> 25:16.840
You're falsely accusing me here.

25:17.310 --> 25:20.109
I had a bad dream.

25:20.310 --> 25:22.378
Whenever I see Yi Chan's late mother in my dream,

25:22.379 --> 25:24.080
he either falls ill or gets hurt.

25:24.409 --> 25:27.419
Anyway, something always happened to Yi Chan in the past.

25:28.480 --> 25:31.089
Why are you just standing around? I told you to lead the way.

25:31.090 --> 25:32.118
What are you, a totem pole?

25:32.119 --> 25:33.590
I can't go there looking like this.

25:34.020 --> 25:36.789
I should wash and style my hair.

25:36.790 --> 25:39.730
Goodness. Forget it. I'll just go there and look for the store.

25:40.230 --> 25:42.230
Wait, hold on.

25:42.330 --> 25:45.269
You can't find it on your own. The Dongdaemun Market is like a maze.

25:45.270 --> 25:46.840
Then lead the way.

25:47.570 --> 25:48.800
Stop complaining and just get going.

25:49.010 --> 25:50.239
Goodness. Go.

25:50.240 --> 25:51.409
(Snail Guesthouse)

25:55.679 --> 25:58.080
Gosh. Don't swing it back and forth like that.

25:58.250 --> 26:00.250
The side dishes inside will get all mixed up.

26:04.689 --> 26:07.419
Oh, no! What a waste.

26:07.590 --> 26:10.260
Gosh, you little weasel.

26:10.929 --> 26:12.158
I bet you did that on purpose.

26:12.159 --> 26:13.628
My gosh. What a waste.

26:13.629 --> 26:15.398
It wasn't intentional, Ms. Go.

26:15.399 --> 26:18.300
Oh, no. I wasted all this food. My goodness.

26:18.869 --> 26:20.399
- You fool.
- I'm sorry.

26:20.500 --> 26:21.898
- Hey, Ha Yi Chan.
- My gosh.

26:21.899 --> 26:24.209
- I did my best.
- I kept telling you to be careful.

26:25.209 --> 26:27.208
- Have you eaten yet?
- Yes, have you?

26:27.209 --> 26:28.310
- Hello.
- Hello.

26:29.179 --> 26:30.510
See, Ma Joo?

26:30.780 --> 26:32.179
This world is a ruthless place.

26:33.050 --> 26:36.090
The others won't even visit their frontman who's in the hospital.

26:36.250 --> 26:38.689
My gosh. I told them you'd be going home tomorrow.

26:39.419 --> 26:40.689
They're so mean.

26:40.959 --> 26:42.889
- Hush.
- Why?

26:58.070 --> 26:59.939
- What?
- My gosh.

27:02.240 --> 27:03.750
(Missing Person, Ha Eun Gyeol)

27:06.350 --> 27:08.350
I put it up all over Mapo-Gu.

27:08.520 --> 27:11.290
I put it in the weekly bulletin at my church just in case.

27:11.449 --> 27:12.989
Why? I thought...

27:12.990 --> 27:14.819
you'd forever be with the guitarist full of the Holy Spirit.

27:14.820 --> 27:17.530
You said only Ha Eun Gyeol could be our guitarist.

27:20.199 --> 27:21.260
That's right.

27:21.899 --> 27:23.469
Guys, didn't Hyun Yul come with you?

27:24.429 --> 27:26.999
That jerk. He has to remain a traitor to the end, doesn't he?

27:27.000 --> 27:28.040
Hey, what are you doing?

27:28.500 --> 27:29.969
Didn't you hear him calling you a traitor?

27:30.740 --> 27:31.740
What?

27:34.010 --> 27:35.179
Darn, what happened to his face?

27:36.879 --> 27:39.080
I fought with a Jindo dog while putting up the poster.

27:46.119 --> 27:47.559
It was a good fight.

27:47.560 --> 27:49.559
My gosh. I'm so touched.

27:49.560 --> 27:50.659
What can we do?

27:50.859 --> 27:52.330
We should follow our frontman's wishes.

27:54.230 --> 27:55.230
Guys.

27:55.560 --> 27:56.769
- Don't.
- Hey, don't.

27:56.770 --> 27:58.029
Honestly, I really appreciate...

27:58.030 --> 27:59.438
- Hey, I told you to stop.
- Say no more.

27:59.439 --> 28:01.468
To thank you for proving your passionate friendship,

28:01.469 --> 28:02.539
I'll do my best to...

28:02.540 --> 28:04.039
Hey, will you please stop?

28:04.040 --> 28:05.339
I told you to stop.

28:05.340 --> 28:06.779
- I'll do my best...
- Stop.

28:06.780 --> 28:08.208
Hey, don't hit me.

28:08.209 --> 28:10.408
- As always, I'll make sure...
- Hey, it hurts. It's me!

28:10.409 --> 28:12.350
I'll show you!

28:13.580 --> 28:14.648
Who's the jerk that said...

28:14.649 --> 28:15.820
I got beaten up by a gang?

28:19.820 --> 28:21.320
Hey, it's okay.

28:21.459 --> 28:24.429
A little bit of embarrassment can become a lasting memory.

28:24.959 --> 28:25.959
My gosh.

28:26.760 --> 28:29.000
Do I really have to tell you this myself?

28:31.270 --> 28:32.300
The legend...

28:34.740 --> 28:36.010
of that intense 10-on-1 fight.

28:37.070 --> 28:38.639
(Missing Person, Ha Eun Gyeol)

28:46.879 --> 28:48.780
Would you take your filthy hands off it?

28:52.419 --> 28:54.490
Before I break your wrists, that is.

28:55.490 --> 28:56.530
A toothpick?

28:57.090 --> 28:58.330
Not a match?

29:09.139 --> 29:11.810
Hey, kid. You're still wet behind the ears. Got a death wish?

29:12.209 --> 29:14.679
Boys, teach him a lesson.

29:25.889 --> 29:27.389
Don't tell me they pulled out guns.

30:12.740 --> 30:14.240
If you mess with my loved ones,

30:16.010 --> 30:17.770
I will never forgive you, no matter who you are.

30:27.949 --> 30:28.949
That moment...

30:29.389 --> 30:31.850
Yi Chan!

30:34.760 --> 30:37.259
"Yi Chan, wake up!"

30:37.260 --> 30:39.329
"Open your eyes!"

30:39.330 --> 30:42.770
"I can't live without you. I'll die!"

30:45.070 --> 30:46.100
Why would I die?

30:47.469 --> 30:48.500
- Se Gyeong.
- Se Gyeong.

30:50.770 --> 30:51.840
Hey, move.

30:52.209 --> 30:53.780
Come here, Se Gyeong. Sit here.

30:54.580 --> 30:55.780
Guys, she saved my life.

30:55.879 --> 30:58.609
The thing is, I wasn't the one who saved you that day.

31:00.080 --> 31:01.149
What?

31:02.149 --> 31:04.119
- It wasn't you?
- That's right.

31:04.320 --> 31:05.419
I knew it.

31:05.550 --> 31:07.358
You went to such lengths to talk total nonsense.

31:07.359 --> 31:08.419
No.

31:08.659 --> 31:10.589
You brought me to the hospital that day.

31:10.590 --> 31:12.590
Yes, that's right. I did,

31:12.760 --> 31:13.999
but someone else found you first...

31:14.000 --> 31:15.898
and asked for my help.

31:15.899 --> 31:18.330
So strictly speaking, she saved your life.

31:18.469 --> 31:19.570
Who was that?

31:20.000 --> 31:21.740
She was a student at Seowon Arts High School.

31:21.939 --> 31:23.669
Her name was...

31:24.709 --> 31:25.869
- Yoon Chung Ah?
- What?

31:26.609 --> 31:28.709
Yoon Chung Ah? Your friend, Yoon Chung Ah?

31:29.080 --> 31:31.249
What? Yoon Chung Ah is my friend?

31:31.250 --> 31:33.479
You gave her the concert ticket and the letter too.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.550
Aren't you two close?

31:34.619 --> 31:36.350
Yes! That's right.

31:36.419 --> 31:38.148
Of course, we're close.

31:38.149 --> 31:39.919
I was just curious what others might think of us.

31:40.189 --> 31:43.059
Right, I always wondered how you two became friends.

31:43.060 --> 31:44.888
Well, how should I put this?

31:44.889 --> 31:46.830
We have great conversations.

31:46.929 --> 31:48.699
What? You two have great conversations?

31:49.330 --> 31:50.928
I thought she couldn't hear.

31:50.929 --> 31:52.698
What? She can't hear?

31:52.699 --> 31:53.968
- What?
- What?

31:53.969 --> 31:55.000
- What?
- What?

31:56.000 --> 31:57.368
The visiting hours are now over,

31:57.369 --> 31:59.270
so everyone must leave the room except for the patient's guardian.

31:59.439 --> 32:00.480
- Okay.
- Got it.

32:01.240 --> 32:02.310
Hey, pass me my cola.

32:06.379 --> 32:07.449
That's blood.

32:08.250 --> 32:11.250
Did you get hurt when I bumped into you earlier?

32:12.990 --> 32:14.490
Hey, wait!

32:14.889 --> 32:15.959
Where are you going?

32:17.230 --> 32:19.760
Why are you dragging me to a dark alley?

32:20.129 --> 32:23.230
That means she couldn't understand a word I said.

32:25.330 --> 32:28.139
Mom had a friend like that? I'm surprised.

32:29.969 --> 32:31.309
- Hey, Se Gyeong.
- Yes?

32:31.310 --> 32:33.279
We're going to grab a bite to eat. Do you want to join us?

32:33.280 --> 32:34.780
Sure, sounds good. What do you feel like eating?

32:34.879 --> 32:37.050
What? Really? You'll come with us?

32:38.949 --> 32:40.549
- I just can't have spicy food.
- Jjajangmyeon.

32:40.550 --> 32:43.218
- Is there anything you're craving?
- I'm hungry, so you guys choose.

32:43.219 --> 32:44.388
- We'll pick something, then.
- Okay.

32:44.389 --> 32:46.320
- How about jjajangmyeon?
- What do you feel like eating?

32:47.560 --> 32:49.559
- Let's just have jjajangmyeon.
- Jjajangmyeon?

32:49.560 --> 32:50.789
No, Jjajangmyeon is spicy.

32:50.790 --> 32:52.358
The one with chilli powder. I don't like it.

32:52.359 --> 32:54.099
- Let's have jjajangmyeon.
- I don't like jjajangmyeon.

32:54.100 --> 32:55.159
Come on. Let's have jjajangmyeon.

32:55.560 --> 32:57.169
How about stir-fried sundae? It's so good.

32:57.600 --> 32:58.799
- Jjajangmyeon is better.
- Agreed.

32:58.800 --> 33:00.339
- No, I don't agree.
- Whatever. Jjajangmyeon, it is.

33:00.340 --> 33:01.369
How about pizza? I'll treat you guys.

33:02.939 --> 33:04.639
- Really? It's on you?
- Se Gyeong, how about pizza?

33:04.969 --> 33:07.179
- What?
- Se Gyeong, how about pizza?

33:07.340 --> 33:08.579
- Se Gyeong.
- Se Gyeong!

33:08.580 --> 33:09.649
Where did she go?

33:10.679 --> 33:12.980
Dad, I'm sorry.

33:15.520 --> 33:17.050
I'm really sorry.

33:18.090 --> 33:20.519
I tried to set Mom up with another man.

33:20.520 --> 33:22.659
I must've been out of my mind for a moment. I'm sorry.

33:23.060 --> 33:24.090
I'm really sorry.

33:24.429 --> 33:25.490
Dr. On.

33:26.560 --> 33:29.158
Your car is a LeMans, right? With the plate number 9125.

33:29.159 --> 33:30.300
Yes, why do you ask?

33:31.030 --> 33:33.698
Why don't you give me your car keys? I'll go put your things...

33:33.699 --> 33:34.840
in your trunk.

33:35.699 --> 33:38.270
By the way, is your surgical site healing well, Ms. Jung?

33:38.469 --> 33:39.480
Pardon me?

33:39.740 --> 33:42.280
I underwent surgery? What do you mean?

33:42.609 --> 33:44.580
You're an angel who had your wings removed. Doesn't it hurt?

33:45.810 --> 33:47.479
My gosh. Dr. On, please.

33:47.480 --> 33:48.850
I got it. I'll take my time with it.

33:48.980 --> 33:50.850
Thank you for offering to help though.

33:51.490 --> 33:54.359
Anyway, the hospital will feel empty starting tomorrow.

33:54.820 --> 33:56.329
Once you become a specialist in the US,

33:56.330 --> 33:57.888
you have to come back and take us out for dinner.

33:57.889 --> 33:59.059
Yes, of course.

33:59.060 --> 34:00.760
Seriously, if you forget me...

34:02.300 --> 34:03.369
I'll be mad at you.

34:04.530 --> 34:06.169
- Promise you won't forget me.
- Okay, I promise.

34:06.439 --> 34:07.499
- Gosh.
- Promise.

34:07.500 --> 34:09.340
Actually, I'm not sorry at all.

34:09.609 --> 34:11.369
He's such a flirt.

34:11.909 --> 34:13.780
He was so flirty even when he was young.

34:14.810 --> 34:15.909
Gosh.

34:17.350 --> 34:19.349
I'm sorry, Dad. But you missed your lucky chance...

34:19.350 --> 34:22.719
to have a pretty daughter named On Eun Yu in the future.

34:22.920 --> 34:23.989
Why?

34:24.250 --> 34:26.560
Mom will marry someone else. That's why.

34:26.659 --> 34:29.089
I'll make it happen.

34:30.659 --> 34:32.389
Who's Mom's future husband?

34:33.000 --> 34:34.959
It's Ha Yi...

34:34.960 --> 34:36.330
Are you sure it's him?

34:38.069 --> 34:40.738
It's probably Ha Yi...

34:40.739 --> 34:41.739
Are you sure about that?

34:43.839 --> 34:46.139
Darn you, Master!

34:46.339 --> 34:48.710
Why do you keep confusing me like this?

34:49.549 --> 34:50.610
Darn it.

35:02.420 --> 35:03.790
If you go back now,

35:04.389 --> 35:06.829
your 2023 will look very different...

35:06.830 --> 35:08.929
from the 2023 you came from.

35:09.199 --> 35:10.730
Do you still wish to go back?

35:12.230 --> 35:13.239
Eun Gyeol.

35:14.000 --> 35:16.509
What's wrong, sweetheart? It's me, your mom.

35:16.869 --> 35:19.139
That was a dream. It was nothing more than a dream.

35:19.679 --> 35:21.480
That can never happen in real life.

35:22.480 --> 35:25.279
There must be a reason I woke up at Mom's place.

35:25.779 --> 35:27.480
I should call Master.

36:02.380 --> 36:03.420
(Call)

36:04.089 --> 36:06.419
The number does not exist.

36:06.420 --> 36:08.860
Check the number and dial again.

36:10.630 --> 36:11.690
Shoot.

36:17.799 --> 36:19.400
Why did you not pick up the phone?

36:19.469 --> 36:21.170
Why did you not pick up the phone?

36:21.670 --> 36:24.539
Stop confusing me and just say it.

36:24.540 --> 36:25.809
Then I'll just go for it.

36:25.810 --> 36:26.909
Is she a loan shark?

36:28.380 --> 36:31.210
Three days. I'll give you just three days.

36:31.549 --> 36:33.349
In three days, you either call me...

36:33.350 --> 36:36.080
or bring that person to me. You decide.

36:36.520 --> 36:39.289
Or I'll miraculously bend your back backward.

36:39.290 --> 36:40.290
Got it?

36:44.630 --> 36:46.659
- Perhaps...
- Perhaps...

36:47.000 --> 36:48.199
- This could mean...
- This could mean...

36:48.360 --> 36:50.499
Mom's first love might be Ha Eun Gyeol.

36:50.500 --> 36:52.770
Choi Se Gyeong might become my mom.

36:52.900 --> 36:54.639
- Is it fate?
- Is it a warning?

36:56.409 --> 36:57.440
Eun Gyeol?

36:58.040 --> 36:59.779
- You're Eun Gyeol, right?
- No, I'm not.

37:00.380 --> 37:02.778
What do you mean you're not? You're Eun Gyeol.

37:02.779 --> 37:04.710
Do you not know me? I'm Choi Se Gyeong.

37:07.619 --> 37:10.149
What's the matter, sweetie? It's me. Your mom.

37:10.150 --> 37:11.949
No. You're not.

37:12.119 --> 37:13.659
- I said you were not.
- My goodness.

37:14.719 --> 37:16.560
What do you mean that I'm not?

37:16.759 --> 37:18.029
Give up, Missus.

37:18.330 --> 37:19.588
You can never be.

37:19.589 --> 37:22.000
"Missus?"

37:22.500 --> 37:24.529
Did you just call me "Missus?"

37:24.770 --> 37:27.170
I'm sorry, but I will never let that happen.

37:28.839 --> 37:30.008
No matter what it takes, I...

37:30.009 --> 37:32.110
I will destroy your relationship with Yi Chan.

37:34.110 --> 37:35.380
What? Hey.

37:35.909 --> 37:37.980
Let go of me when I'm being nice, Missus.

37:38.080 --> 37:40.249
Shut your mouth when I'm being nice, Mister.

37:40.250 --> 37:41.750
- Missus.
- Mister.

37:42.520 --> 37:44.650
I'm not doing this because I like you.

37:44.850 --> 37:46.790
You're 200 times uglier than my dad.

37:47.819 --> 37:49.729
I just need to check something.

37:49.730 --> 37:51.230
So don't say anything and follow me.

37:51.589 --> 37:53.529
I'll be polite since you're older than me.

37:54.659 --> 37:55.830
Let go of me.

37:56.230 --> 37:57.730
I said, "Let go of me."

37:58.770 --> 38:02.069
You should know that I'm the one who is being polite.

38:02.270 --> 38:04.540
- Seriously.
- Stop it, will you?

38:05.239 --> 38:06.610
Where are you going?

38:07.909 --> 38:09.179
Enjoy your meal.

38:09.679 --> 38:12.310
- What's this?
- Why do you ask? It's jokbal.

38:12.810 --> 38:14.350
It looks amazing.

38:19.250 --> 38:21.089
Gosh, it smells so good.

38:22.619 --> 38:24.559
I followed you because you said you needed to check something.

38:24.560 --> 38:26.360
And you give me pig's trotters?

38:26.389 --> 38:28.330
How are you doing after running away?

38:28.400 --> 38:29.528
Have you been eating?

38:29.529 --> 38:31.368
It's not bad. I've been eating well.

38:31.369 --> 38:32.400
Are you done checking?

38:32.670 --> 38:33.739
Wait.

38:35.339 --> 38:36.469
Eat this before you go.

38:38.810 --> 38:41.440
Just have one bite at least. Please.

38:47.020 --> 38:50.319
Why should I eat this?

38:50.889 --> 38:53.790
Someone's life is at stake. Please do as I say.

39:13.040 --> 39:15.178
- Let me ask you something first.
- My gosh.

39:15.179 --> 39:16.810
You can ask after eating.

39:16.909 --> 39:18.610
"Everything goes better on a full stomach." Don't you know it?

39:19.350 --> 39:22.079
Here. Open your mouth.

39:22.080 --> 39:23.349
My life is at stake.

39:23.350 --> 39:25.420
That's why I'm asking you to have a bite before then.

39:25.520 --> 39:27.460
Your answer will decide someone's... No.

39:28.020 --> 39:29.559
A whole family's fate.

39:29.560 --> 39:32.089
Why are you saying that in front of jokbal?

39:34.900 --> 39:35.960
Go on.

39:40.040 --> 39:42.270
You said you were not playing with Yi Chan's feelings.

39:43.139 --> 39:45.810
And you also said people can change their minds.

39:46.940 --> 39:48.310
The jokbal is getting cold.

39:48.779 --> 39:50.549
So what do you think of Yi Chan now?

39:52.480 --> 39:53.520
Do you like him?

39:54.520 --> 39:56.819
Hold on. I should be careful here.

39:57.290 --> 39:58.718
I'm not done checking yet.

39:58.719 --> 40:00.459
If I say I like Yi Chan,

40:00.460 --> 40:01.920
I might upset him for no reason.

40:03.630 --> 40:05.790
- I'll say, "No comment." - Then I won't eat either.

40:05.960 --> 40:07.758
What's your problem?

40:07.759 --> 40:09.559
We agreed to play fair.

40:09.560 --> 40:10.928
Then you should keep good manners.

40:10.929 --> 40:12.368
Answer me. I'll eat then.

40:12.369 --> 40:13.799
Eat. I'll answer then.

40:17.969 --> 40:19.139
Let's just stop.

40:19.810 --> 40:21.739
Oh, my goodness. He's so...

40:22.040 --> 40:24.610
Excuse me. Could you box this up for me?

40:25.110 --> 40:27.549
Eun Gyeol. Wait.

40:27.980 --> 40:29.920
Stop there for a moment.

40:31.049 --> 40:32.949
I got it. I'll let you go.

40:33.150 --> 40:34.559
I'll let you go.

40:34.560 --> 40:36.389
Just tell me where you're staying before you go.

40:36.589 --> 40:38.360
Why should I tell you that?

40:38.460 --> 40:40.359
Aren't you worried about people who are waiting for you?

40:40.360 --> 40:42.229
They need to know how you're doing at least.

40:42.230 --> 40:44.270
- Yi Chan has been looking for you.
- I'm warning you.

40:44.869 --> 40:46.799
Don't you ever say his name in front of me.

40:47.270 --> 40:49.909
Gosh, is he a traitor or something?

40:50.069 --> 40:51.638
Did you catch him plotting treason?

40:51.639 --> 40:54.439
I have a place to stay. I've never skipped a meal.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.580
And I got a job.

40:55.739 --> 40:56.979
Most importantly,

40:56.980 --> 40:58.980
there's something I need to do and I should put my life on it.

40:59.080 --> 41:00.150
Are we done now?

41:01.319 --> 41:03.349
Why on earth are you being like this? Are you going through puberty?

41:03.350 --> 41:05.350
Are you unhappy because the Earth isn't moving as you want?

41:05.489 --> 41:08.389
What did Yi Chan do wrong for you to act like this?

41:15.460 --> 41:17.299
I think you're mistaken.

41:17.869 --> 41:21.139
I don't hate Yi Chan. I hate you who is beside him.

41:21.699 --> 41:23.069
I hate you.

41:26.369 --> 41:28.239
You shouldn't have pushed me to say this.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.980
I'm sorry, Missus.

41:31.580 --> 41:33.920
Please understand that I had no choice.

41:34.520 --> 41:37.589
When I go back to 2023, I'll pay for everything I did.

41:38.449 --> 41:39.549
Gosh.

41:40.259 --> 41:41.860
What kind of absurd situation is this?

41:42.759 --> 41:43.790
My goodness.

41:43.929 --> 41:46.259
Mom was treated like this by a man like him?

41:48.000 --> 41:49.230
I shouldn't be like this.

41:49.969 --> 41:51.900
If I feel offended, I'm losing. Darn it.

41:54.440 --> 41:56.540
It hurt my feelings.

41:57.670 --> 41:58.710
Gosh.

42:05.850 --> 42:07.480
Do you really have to do that?

42:08.650 --> 42:11.589
My grandma told me that I should thank people without putting it off.

42:12.089 --> 42:14.360
It's something I should do for my lifesaver as a human.

42:16.830 --> 42:17.929
But are you sure it's that house?

42:18.259 --> 42:19.889
- Yes, I'm sure.
- Gosh.

42:20.360 --> 42:23.399
You climbed over the wall to see Se Gyeong and got humiliated.

42:23.400 --> 42:25.028
It's that house you got kicked out of as you ruined the party.

42:25.029 --> 42:26.399
The house of the chairwoman of Seowon Arts High School.

42:26.400 --> 42:28.940
- Gosh, it's a long address.
- Yes.

42:29.239 --> 42:31.170
And you know what? It's the house of the Jinsung Family.

42:31.569 --> 42:34.939
It means Chung Ah is the daughter of a conglomerate.

42:34.940 --> 42:36.610
But don't be intimidated.

42:41.219 --> 42:42.250
Gosh.

42:46.690 --> 42:48.119
Intimidated, my foot.

43:01.199 --> 43:02.339
Who is it?

43:03.839 --> 43:06.539
Hello, I'm Ha Yi Chan in grade 11, class 3,

43:06.540 --> 43:08.480
in Baekwang High School.

43:08.739 --> 43:10.048
The reason why I came...

43:10.049 --> 43:13.179
is because I have something to say to Chung Ah.

43:13.420 --> 43:15.480
May I see her for a moment, please?

43:15.750 --> 43:17.150
Just give me a moment.

43:17.350 --> 43:18.389
Yes, ma'am.

43:19.920 --> 43:21.560
I'm not intimidated at all.

43:23.119 --> 43:24.230
Oh, right.

43:27.560 --> 43:28.560
"Thank you."

43:29.060 --> 43:30.100
"You..."

43:30.770 --> 43:33.000
"saved me."

43:35.400 --> 43:36.500
"I'm sorry."

43:36.739 --> 43:39.040
"I didn't know."

43:39.339 --> 43:41.440
- Hello.
- Yes?

43:42.009 --> 43:44.080
She doesn't know you. She told you to leave.

43:44.949 --> 43:47.020
Sorry? It's impossible.

43:47.580 --> 43:49.118
Can you please talk to her again?

43:49.119 --> 43:51.920
She said she didn't know you. You should leave now.

43:51.949 --> 43:54.060
Wait.

43:55.190 --> 43:58.029
Ring the bell one more time. I'll call the police.

44:34.259 --> 44:35.529
There's a navigation system in your body.

44:35.900 --> 44:38.770
You know when you scratch your head while waiting for someone.

44:38.900 --> 44:41.838
If you scratch the back of your head, it means you should wait more.

44:41.839 --> 44:44.009
If you scratch the front of your head, you'll meet the person soon.

44:48.610 --> 44:49.610
Darn it.

45:10.230 --> 45:15.270
(Ha Yi Chan)

45:37.560 --> 45:38.830
I'm sorry for making you wait.

45:42.259 --> 45:44.100
Why don't we sit down?

46:06.219 --> 46:09.460
Is Yoon Chung Ah your biological daughter, sir?

46:16.429 --> 46:18.330
You saw, heard, and experienced...

46:18.699 --> 46:20.600
some things at my house.

46:21.400 --> 46:23.809
I'm having this meeting with you, so you can tell me...

46:23.810 --> 46:26.170
all about that before you tell the whole world.

46:27.380 --> 46:29.778
I thought you were going to spill everything,

46:29.779 --> 46:31.409
but you asked me a daring question instead.

46:33.409 --> 46:34.719
What's your angle?

46:35.350 --> 46:37.219
If she is indeed your biological daughter,

46:38.389 --> 46:40.319
why wouldn't you let her use sign language?

46:41.420 --> 46:42.460
No.

46:43.520 --> 46:46.330
Why didn't you teach her sign language from the start?

46:46.790 --> 46:47.860
Why didn't I?

46:48.929 --> 46:50.529
I have a simple reason for that.

46:51.330 --> 46:53.368
There's no need to make it obvious to everyone...

46:53.369 --> 46:55.369
that my daughter has a disability.

46:56.969 --> 46:59.069
Nor did I want anyone to know about her disability.

47:05.679 --> 47:06.980
Those are sad eyes.

47:07.779 --> 47:08.850
Why?

47:18.630 --> 47:21.230
The chairman talked to you, right?

47:23.000 --> 47:26.630
Starting today, I'll be tutoring you.

47:28.270 --> 47:30.940
Aren't you curious about what you'll be learning from me?

47:31.639 --> 47:32.869
He seems kind.

47:33.610 --> 47:34.639
Why?

47:35.380 --> 47:36.380
It's sign language.

47:37.549 --> 47:41.020
Sounds we make with our hands.

47:44.319 --> 47:46.750
It's what you taught me when I was a baby.

47:54.199 --> 47:55.259
He's crying.

47:56.529 --> 47:57.569
Why?

48:00.299 --> 48:01.369
But...

48:03.040 --> 48:05.969
it's a secret to other people.

48:07.139 --> 48:08.509
A secret that only you,

48:09.679 --> 48:11.409
the chairman, and I will know.

48:14.080 --> 48:16.750
Then let's begin.

48:18.589 --> 48:19.690
Come and sit down.

48:37.000 --> 48:39.710
First of all, let me introduce myself.

48:41.040 --> 48:42.139
My name is...

48:43.040 --> 48:44.779
Ha Eun Gyeol.

48:46.580 --> 48:47.650
Ha.

48:48.380 --> 48:49.420
Eun.

48:50.549 --> 48:51.619
Gyeol.

48:54.290 --> 48:55.520
"A clear sound."

48:57.960 --> 48:59.659
"Clear..."

50:08.659 --> 50:09.799
What's your name?

50:10.500 --> 50:11.770
It's Ha Eun Gyeol.

50:12.069 --> 50:13.199
Ha Eun Gyeol?

50:14.339 --> 50:15.869
You seem young. How old are you?

50:18.069 --> 50:19.139
I'm 18.

50:20.580 --> 50:22.508
Your parents must be very worried.

50:22.509 --> 50:23.738
Let's call your parents first.

50:23.739 --> 50:24.750
My parents...

50:26.610 --> 50:28.580
are in another world now.

50:32.920 --> 50:34.060
Does it mean you're an orphan?

50:35.920 --> 50:37.190
For now, sort of.

50:38.060 --> 50:39.060
Just for now.

50:39.330 --> 50:41.159
Are there any relatives or guardians you can call?

50:41.560 --> 50:42.600
There's no one.

50:45.199 --> 50:47.569
It sounds like you don't have a place to go.

50:50.839 --> 50:52.109
Until you recover your health,

50:52.110 --> 50:53.839
you should stay in the guest room.

50:54.310 --> 50:55.940
It was a natural disaster,

50:56.139 --> 50:59.049
but the accident took place at the event my company held.

50:59.480 --> 51:01.850
I will offer my generosity until you fully recover.

51:02.420 --> 51:05.619
Of course, I will provide you with proper monetary compensation.

51:06.719 --> 51:08.860
I would like to teach your daughter sign language.

51:10.790 --> 51:11.929
You want to do what?

51:12.389 --> 51:14.299
I don't need any other compensation.

51:14.759 --> 51:16.560
Let me teach her sign language just while I stay...

51:16.759 --> 51:17.868
in your guest room.

51:17.869 --> 51:20.129
Perhaps, you're mistaken that you're entitled to my generosity.

51:20.130 --> 51:22.670
I'm pleading with you for the happiness of your daughter.

51:23.770 --> 51:25.408
Look, kid.

51:25.409 --> 51:27.210
My parents were deaf too.

51:28.409 --> 51:30.179
Despite that, they were cheerful,

51:31.480 --> 51:32.549
healthy,

51:34.319 --> 51:35.779
and overly happy...

51:36.880 --> 51:37.920
because...

51:40.589 --> 51:41.960
they could communicate...

51:43.520 --> 51:46.159
with their eyes, their hearts,

51:47.130 --> 51:48.230
and their hands.

51:49.560 --> 51:51.468
Learning sign language will make her happy?

51:51.469 --> 51:52.469
What a strange argument.

51:52.470 --> 51:53.730
It's not strange.

51:54.799 --> 51:55.838
It doesn't matter what the intention is.

51:55.839 --> 51:57.638
Taking away the ability to speak...

51:57.639 --> 51:59.040
is the same as taking away their world.

51:59.069 --> 52:02.110
It's equivalent to colonizing someone's soul.

52:02.580 --> 52:04.409
You make sign language sound so grand.

52:04.710 --> 52:08.549
All right. What's the conclusion of this touching lecture?

52:12.119 --> 52:13.190
I want to give back...

52:14.889 --> 52:16.619
the world to your daughter.

52:18.360 --> 52:19.389
What?

52:19.529 --> 52:21.860
So she won't be lonely like an isolated island anymore.

52:23.330 --> 52:25.100
So she won't be discriminated for her difference.

52:27.569 --> 52:28.900
I want to build a bridge for her...

52:30.299 --> 52:31.339
at home...

52:32.639 --> 52:33.710
and...

52:43.350 --> 52:44.448
at her school too.

52:44.449 --> 52:46.119
(Ha Eun Gyeol)

52:47.150 --> 52:48.219
Ha Eun Gyeol.

52:48.560 --> 52:50.689
What you said to me left an imprint on my mind,

52:50.690 --> 52:52.259
so I stayed up all night. Darn it.

52:52.960 --> 52:55.500
So you're not going to cooperate?

52:56.000 --> 52:57.368
If he's not going to answer my question,

52:57.369 --> 52:59.369
I have no choice but to ask around to get my answer.

53:00.469 --> 53:02.569
That's not Yoon Chung Ah.

53:03.739 --> 53:05.469
That's not Yoon Chung Ah.

53:06.509 --> 53:08.439
If she's Mom's friend, she must know...

53:08.440 --> 53:10.609
the relationship between Mom and Ha Eun Gyeol...

53:10.610 --> 53:12.480
and who Mom's first love is.

53:13.710 --> 53:15.920
Not Yoon Chung Ah.

53:18.489 --> 53:19.520
What's up with that car?

53:24.190 --> 53:26.130
He looks just like Ha Eun Gyeol.

53:26.790 --> 53:28.299
Wait, no. That is Ha Eun Gyeol.

53:28.960 --> 53:30.230
What? That's Yoon Chung Ah.

53:31.069 --> 53:32.799
How come they're coming out of the same car?

53:33.900 --> 53:37.369
Anyway, I can kill 2 birds with 1 stone. It'll be 2 for 1.

53:37.440 --> 53:38.468
I should go and talk to them.

53:38.469 --> 53:39.509
Hey.

53:39.670 --> 53:41.040
Isn't that Yoon Chung Ah from Art Department, right?

53:41.110 --> 53:43.109
- Excuse me, girls.
- Who's that new guy?

53:43.110 --> 53:44.249
- Let me walk you...
- What? Who's that?

53:44.250 --> 53:45.979
- Let me pass through.
- to your classroom.

53:45.980 --> 53:48.249
- Who's that?
- What's going on?

53:48.250 --> 53:49.849
- Look at his face.
- Excuse me.

53:49.850 --> 53:51.649
- Hey, he's going up.
- Excuse me. Girls.

53:51.650 --> 53:53.249
- I haven't seen him around before.
- What a surprise.

53:53.250 --> 53:55.088
- Right. I guess he goes here.
- Gosh.

53:55.089 --> 53:56.089
This is crazy.

53:56.090 --> 53:57.830
Hey, Yoon Chung Ah! Ha Eun Gyeol!

54:00.799 --> 54:01.860
It's me!

54:05.230 --> 54:07.670
Come on. That annoying jerk.

54:08.170 --> 54:09.940
You with the helmet. Stop!

54:10.139 --> 54:11.210
Gosh.

54:12.369 --> 54:14.440
- I just need to give them...
- No.

54:18.949 --> 54:20.080
What's this?

54:20.250 --> 54:21.920
I thought we were getting T-shirts for the band.

54:22.279 --> 54:24.250
Designer Foot Mountain worked on this.

54:24.489 --> 54:26.250
I gave it an avant-garde look.

54:26.790 --> 54:29.190
Then Ma Joo's father charged us only for the fabric.

54:29.520 --> 54:30.589
Go.

54:30.989 --> 54:32.529
If you're in need of fabric,

54:32.630 --> 54:34.600
come to Ma Joo's Fabrics in Dongdaemun.

54:35.500 --> 54:38.329
There's a subsidiary called Ma Joo's Laces.

54:38.330 --> 54:41.139
This can't be a band T-shirt. It's a missing person poster.

54:41.339 --> 54:42.339
- This is so lame.
- This is so lame.

54:42.340 --> 54:43.568
- How do you expect us to wear it?
- How do you expect us to wear it?

54:43.569 --> 54:45.869
Why can't you wear it? Don't you have any loyalty at all?

54:46.069 --> 54:48.278
We'll wear them and give out flyers until we find him.

54:48.279 --> 54:50.040
That's all you have to know. Got it?

54:50.509 --> 54:51.679
Come on. This is a nice T-shirt.

54:52.509 --> 54:54.179
Gosh. It's Se Gyeong.

54:57.920 --> 54:59.619
Can someone put him back in the hospital?

55:00.250 --> 55:01.860
Preferably, a hospital he'll be locked up inside.

55:02.119 --> 55:03.659
You have one message.

55:04.389 --> 55:06.429
Yi Chan, brace yourself and listen up.

55:07.659 --> 55:10.029
Gosh, no way. Is she going to confess her feelings to me?

55:10.400 --> 55:12.929
I found Ha Eun Gyeol.

55:17.639 --> 55:18.769
Get out of my way!

55:18.770 --> 55:20.368
- I don't know how it happened, - Move, everyone! Out of my way!

55:20.369 --> 55:22.310
but he was at Seowon Arts High School with Yoon Chung Ah today.

55:26.509 --> 55:27.549
(Choi Se Gyeong)

55:30.449 --> 55:32.089
I'll look into this a bit more.

55:32.219 --> 55:34.218
Don't do anything rash until you fully recover...

55:34.219 --> 55:35.719
from your injuries.

55:43.529 --> 55:44.529
Guys.

55:45.869 --> 55:47.770
Why don't we stir up some trouble today?

55:51.139 --> 55:52.409
Did he live abroad?

55:53.139 --> 55:55.639
Being a gentleman is like second nature to him.

55:56.710 --> 55:58.310
A gentleman? As if.

55:58.549 --> 55:59.909
He's an orphan.

56:00.179 --> 56:01.749
A scholarship foundation from my father's company...

56:01.750 --> 56:02.778
is sponsoring him.

56:02.779 --> 56:04.150
What? Really?

56:05.190 --> 56:07.350
I have no idea how he managed to get my father on board.

56:08.060 --> 56:09.920
But he'll be staying at my house for the time being.

56:10.589 --> 56:12.588
In return, he'll do tutoring sessions at my house.

56:12.589 --> 56:16.230
He'll work as a part-timer at school as Yoon Chung Ah's assistant.

56:16.759 --> 56:18.729
He's basically a glorified servant.

56:18.730 --> 56:20.000
Yes. That's it.

56:20.600 --> 56:21.639
Gosh.

56:22.000 --> 56:23.670
I guess I have a thing for servants.

56:23.940 --> 56:25.508
I just understood why mistresses fell for servants.

56:25.509 --> 56:26.540
Hey.

56:26.869 --> 56:28.338
We have an announcement.

56:28.339 --> 56:30.479
A student named Ha Eun Gyeol in 11th grade...

56:30.480 --> 56:33.909
must report to the chairman's office upon hearing this announcement.

56:34.449 --> 56:36.020
Let me repeat the announcement.

56:36.480 --> 56:38.318
A student named Ha Eun Gyeol in 11th grade...

56:38.319 --> 56:39.849
must report to the chairman's office...

56:39.850 --> 56:41.989
- Someone is looking for me.
- upon hearing this announcement.

56:42.389 --> 56:43.659
I'll be back soon.

56:44.060 --> 56:45.060
Will you be okay?

56:57.969 --> 56:59.009
Choi Se Gyeong

57:00.440 --> 57:02.008
What do you think you're doing?

57:02.009 --> 57:05.279
Gosh. I guess I wasn't invisible.

57:05.949 --> 57:06.949
Can you see me?

57:09.420 --> 57:10.750
Gosh. Come on.

57:13.719 --> 57:15.420
I need to talk to you. Come with me quietly.

57:15.619 --> 57:16.819
It's about Yi Chan.

57:18.630 --> 57:20.560
Hey.

57:24.569 --> 57:26.368
How much farther? Just talk to me here.

57:26.369 --> 57:28.900
Gosh. There's a reason I can't be seen. Seriously.

57:47.520 --> 57:49.360
Tell me what this is about. I must get going soon.

57:50.489 --> 57:52.029
What's your relationship with Yoon Chung Ah?

57:52.130 --> 57:53.959
You said this was about Yi Chan.

57:53.960 --> 57:56.059
Yes, it is about him. So just answer my question.

57:56.060 --> 57:57.868
Did you jump ship from Yi Chan to Yoon Chung Ah?

57:57.869 --> 57:59.729
Come on. How many times must I tell you...

57:59.730 --> 58:00.969
I don't have a thing for him?

58:01.069 --> 58:03.440
So you and I aren't love rivals.

58:03.600 --> 58:05.569
Then why do you hate me so much?

58:05.969 --> 58:07.209
Do you need a reason for that?

58:07.210 --> 58:08.639
Yes! I very much do!

58:08.739 --> 58:10.579
It's not fair to be hated without a reason.

58:10.580 --> 58:11.679
When I look at you,

58:14.819 --> 58:17.419
I just get angry. Anger drives me crazy!

58:17.420 --> 58:18.690
Okay? Are you happy now?

58:19.350 --> 58:21.658
Even so, how could you abandon Yi Chan because of me? You jerk.

58:21.659 --> 58:23.488
Yi Chan was giving out flyers to find you.

58:23.489 --> 58:24.489
That's how he got beaten up, got hit in the head,

58:24.490 --> 58:25.589
and was hospitalized too.

58:29.199 --> 58:30.759
Hello!

58:31.199 --> 58:34.339
Students of Seowon Arts High School!

58:34.639 --> 58:37.339
We're the school band from Baekwang High School.

58:37.400 --> 58:40.439
We are First Love Memory Manipulators!

58:40.440 --> 58:41.480
What?

58:42.210 --> 58:45.350
This is for all of you who must be exhausted from studying too hard.

58:45.750 --> 58:49.749
I would like to sing this song to show my support...

58:49.750 --> 58:52.350
- for your passion and youth...
- Four, five, six,

58:53.119 --> 58:56.118
- seven, eight. One.
- that must be burning brightly!

58:56.119 --> 58:57.419
- What's he doing?
- Let's go.

58:57.420 --> 58:59.389
One, two.

58:59.489 --> 59:01.830
One, two, three, four.

59:02.759 --> 59:04.429
(Come back to us, Ha Eun Gyeol!)

59:06.100 --> 59:07.130
- Gosh.
- Let's go.

59:16.440 --> 59:20.850
When I gaze at the setting sun, tinged with red

59:21.350 --> 59:24.549
The sad look on your face comes to my mind

59:25.020 --> 59:28.360
I sink my head, and tears fall down

59:28.690 --> 59:31.230
There's nothing I can say

59:31.330 --> 59:33.989
- But the truth is that I love you - But the truth is that I love you

59:34.699 --> 59:37.630
- You are my world - You are my world

59:38.429 --> 59:41.238
- I'm screaming that to the world - I'm screaming that to the world

59:41.239 --> 59:45.369
- But the setting sun burns silently - But the setting sun burns silently

59:45.969 --> 59:48.838
- The truth is that I love you - The truth is that I love you

59:48.839 --> 59:49.839
- Ha Eun Gyeol!
- Ha Eun Gyeol!

59:49.840 --> 59:52.278
- You are my world - You are my world

59:52.279 --> 59:53.279
- Ha Eun Gyeol!
- Ha Eun Gyeol!

59:53.280 --> 59:56.020
- I'm screaming that to the world - I'm screaming that to the world

59:56.049 --> 01:00:00.089
- But the setting sun burns silently - But the setting sun burns silently

01:00:02.020 --> 01:00:05.989
(Come back to us, Ha Eun Gyeol!)

01:00:12.170 --> 01:00:13.299
Welcome back, Eun Gyeol.

01:00:14.639 --> 01:00:16.100
I've been waiting for a long time.

01:00:17.170 --> 01:00:18.909
How did you know I was here?

01:00:19.270 --> 01:00:20.469
Se Gyeong told me.

01:00:24.080 --> 01:00:25.080
Eun Gyeol.

01:00:26.150 --> 01:00:27.310
I'm sorry.

01:00:29.179 --> 01:00:30.549
From now on, I'll do my best...

01:00:30.850 --> 01:00:32.719
for the band, to study,

01:00:33.190 --> 01:00:34.690
and to keep all of my promises to you.

01:00:35.989 --> 01:00:38.159
You might think you're wasting your time with me.

01:00:40.029 --> 01:00:41.259
But I'll try to make it worth your time.

01:00:42.029 --> 01:00:45.369
I'll do my best not to waste your time and to improve.

01:00:47.029 --> 01:00:48.339
So come back to us.

01:00:49.540 --> 01:00:52.409
You're the only guitarist for First Love Memory Manipulators.

01:01:06.350 --> 01:01:08.089
- Fine. Let's do it.
- Really?

01:01:09.119 --> 01:01:11.658
You mean it, right? You can't back out now! Okay?

01:01:11.659 --> 01:01:14.158
- Under one condition.
- Yes. What is it?

01:01:14.159 --> 01:01:16.259
Tell me anything you want. I'll make it happen for you.

01:01:17.130 --> 01:01:18.400
Stop seeing Choi Se Gyeong.

01:01:22.400 --> 01:01:23.400
What?

01:01:26.909 --> 01:01:28.339
If you don't, we can't play together...

01:01:29.440 --> 01:01:30.480
because...

01:01:32.210 --> 01:01:33.210
Because?

01:01:34.210 --> 01:01:35.819
I like Choi Se Gyeong.

01:01:36.549 --> 01:01:39.389
- The truth is that I love you - The truth is that I love you

01:01:40.089 --> 01:01:42.889
- You are my world - You are my world

01:01:43.719 --> 01:01:46.459
- I'm screaming that to the world - I'm screaming that to the world

01:01:46.460 --> 01:01:53.400
- But the setting sun burns silently - But the setting sun burns silently

01:02:33.869 --> 01:02:38.549
(Twinkling Watermelon)

01:02:38.750 --> 01:02:41.048
He told the entire school he liked me. How can he act like that?

01:02:41.049 --> 01:02:42.519
When can I get an answer?

01:02:42.520 --> 01:02:44.318
- What answer?
- An answer to my confession.

01:02:44.319 --> 01:02:46.388
When you told me that you liked Se Gyeong,

01:02:46.389 --> 01:02:47.448
everything clicked.

01:02:47.449 --> 01:02:48.519
I'm sorry about that.

01:02:48.520 --> 01:02:49.888
Let's keep it fair between us.

01:02:49.889 --> 01:02:51.689
So both of us shouldn't see her until the school festival.

01:02:51.690 --> 01:02:52.989
Sure. I'm in!

01:02:53.159 --> 01:02:55.059
Se Gyeong will be going to school starting today.

01:02:55.060 --> 01:02:57.698
Then she'll be seeing that jerk, Ha Eun Gyeol, at school every day.

01:02:57.699 --> 01:03:00.169
From what I heard, they're already chasing each other.

01:03:00.170 --> 01:03:01.940
Why on earth are you going this far?

01:03:02.100 --> 01:03:04.199
I have no choice but to do this, so Mom and Dad end up together.

01:03:04.739 --> 01:03:07.139
Can you throw the ball only to me?

01:03:08.794 --> 01:03:10.894
Dramaday.me
